rota lap 4303, row 3 -- Water, the row that tastes; its dual seat growing-a-language names the Rye-Rishi seam that never flattens a value to text, which is the design half of the fork count this lap measured, and reading it up close is what turned a repair lap into a refutation of my own framing.
file external-research/20260908-111149_the-fork-bill-is-a-shape.md the paper -- three forms, one answer, and the finding that refutes the hypothesis it set out to prove
