status GREEN for the work, PARTIAL for the record: the paper landed at A/91 and the card at 40,945 of 40,960, and the REDS row this lap diagnosed was WITHDRAWN because the ledger pin is full and the pre-commit wall refused it. The clean hot pass read 178 guards, 174 green, 3 gated, tree_moved=no, one red -- the live_group_plant leg diagnosed above, ninth firing, not of this lap's making.
